<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js" integrity="sha384-1n8ObDnXYHS4LyD60N9itcI6qfqEXa0Ei/QvO9c0ndJ7N8qQ9qJXxwfw1GRpsA==" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Helvetica:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            margin: 40px auto;
            max-width: 800px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #111;
            background: #fff;
        }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', sans-serif;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 3px double #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .column {
            column-count: 2;
            column-gap: 40px;
        }
        .column p, .column ul {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border: 2px solid #ccc;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }
        .placeholder::after {
            content: "Diagram: centered";
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            color: #999;
        }
        img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .table th, .table td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>REPORT TITLE</h1>
        <p><strong>Classification: CONFIDENTIAL</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
        <p>This is the first paragraph of the document. It contains the main body text that spans the entire width of the page.</p>
        <p>Additional text follows directly below, maintaining the same paragraph flow and spacing as the original layout.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Bullet point 1 – first item in the list</li>
            <li>Bullet point 2 – second item</li>
            <li>Bullet point 3 – third item</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="placeholder">[Diagram: centered]</div>
        <p>Text continues below the diagram.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
        <p>Second column text block – starts at the same vertical position as the first column.</p>
        <p>This text is aligned exactly with the left column for spatial fidelity.</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Numbered list item 1</li>
            <li>Numbered list item 2</li>
            <li>Numbered list item 3</li>
        </ol>
        <div class="placeholder">[Chart: bottom-left]</div>
        <p>More text in the second column.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Section Heading</h2>
    <p>Sub-section text appears here with proper indentation and line spacing.</p>
    <p><strong>Bold text</strong> is used for emphasis where it appears in the original document.</p>

    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Column Header 1</th>
                <th>Column Header 2</th>
                <th>Column Header 3</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Row 1, Cell 1</td>
                <td>Row 1, Cell 2</td>
                <td>Row 1, Cell 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Row 2, Cell 1</td>
                <td>Row 2, Cell 2</td>
                <td>Row 2, Cell 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Row 3, Cell 1</td>
                <td>Row 3, Cell 2</td>
                <td>Row 3, Cell 3</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>Footer text or additional notes appear at the bottom of the page in the same font and size as the body text.</p>

    <script>
        MathJax.typeset();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
